## 7. 项目状态机

推荐的权威状态如下：

```text
INTAKE
→ QUESTION_NORMALIZED
→ SCOPE_RESOLVED
→ SUBQUESTIONS_DEFINED
→ EVIDENCE_PLANNED
→ RESOURCES_DISCOVERED
→ RESOURCES_VERIFIED
→ DATASETS_FEASIBILITY_REVIEWED
→ DATASETS_LOCKED
→ METHODS_SELECTED
→ WORKFLOW_COMPILED
→ EXECUTION_AUTHORIZED
→ TASKS_RUNNING
→ ARTIFACTS_REGISTERED
→ QC_COMPLETED
→ EVIDENCE_EXTRACTED
→ CLAIMS_SYNTHESIZED
→ ALIGNMENT_AUDITED
→ REPORT_READY
→ REPRODUCTION_BUNDLE_READY
```

### 合法终态

```text
COMPLETED
PARTIALLY_COMPLETED
INSUFFICIENT_DATA
METHOD_NOT_APPLICABLE
INCONCLUSIVE
CONFLICTING_EVIDENCE
FAILED_TECHNICALLY
CANCELLED_BY_USER
REQUIRES_HUMAN_DECISION
```

### 状态要求

- 状态只能通过事件推进；
- 每次状态变化必须记录 actor、输入、输出、时间和理由；
- 失败后可局部回退到最近的有效检查点；
- 不能通过改写一个 JSON 文件静默改变历史；
- 当前状态必须能够从不可变事件日志重建。

